+- `afterModelResponse` is called once per user message after the round loop exits and receives `totalUsage` — the summed provider-call usage for the entire turn, so tool rounds are included in a deployer's billing or audit total and existing consumers record the full turn cost rather than the final call alone ([validated by: reports the summed usage from every provider call in a turn with two tool rounds](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestratorUsage.acceptance.test.ts#L44)).
+- Rounds that report no usage drop out of the sum rather than voiding it, and when no provider call in the turn reports usage `afterModelResponse` receives `undefined` rather than a zeroed total ([validated by: counts reported rounds while leaving a turn with no reported usage undefined](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestratorUsage.acceptance.test.ts#L67)).
